    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Little Shark's Outings",
        "jpn": "おでかけ子ザメ"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Follows a little shark character, Kozame-chan's adventures in Yauo town, which smells \"nostalgic.\" From radio exercises to festival stalls to meeting with friends, Kozame-chan has a variety of heartwarming experiences in the town.",
        "jpn": "小さなサメのキャラクター、コザメちゃんの「懐かしい」匂いがするヤウオ町での冒険を描きます。 ラジオ体操、お祭りの屋台、友達との出会いなど、こざめちゃんは町でさまざまな心温まる体験をします。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Odekake Kozame",
        "Outgoing Babyshark",
        "Little Shark's Day Out"
    ],
